  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Thank you, Grant, you're verified. I'm sorry your kids ended up with cereal for dinner.\n\nI checked the courier's records. The courier's vehicle broke down, and the order was never handed to anyone. The app marked it \"delivered\" automatically, and that status was wrong.\n\nI've refunded the full amount you were charged, **$87.55**, to your Visa ending in 4242. That includes the tip and fees. It should arrive in 3\u20135 business days.\n\nIs there anything else I can help with?"
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Okay, thanks for looking into it. Can you tell me what the order number is so I have it for my records? I also want to know that the refund covers everything, the three pizzas, the garlic knots and the soda, plus the fees."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "The order number is **Q-8201**. The refund reference is **RF-4000**.\n\nThe $87.55 refund covers everything you were charged:\n- 2 large pepperoni pizzas: $42.00\n- 1 large veggie pizza: $22.00\n- Garlic knots: $7.50\n- 2L soda: $2.50\n- Service fee: $5.55\n- Tip: $8.00\n\nThe delivery fee was $0. The items add up to $74.00, and with the service fee and tip the total is $87.55. It will go back to your Visa ending in 4242.\n\nIs there anything else I can help with?"
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Okay, that breakdown works for me. Thanks for the refund reference too. Now I'd like something for the trouble. My kids were pretty upset and it ruined our dinner, and I'm a Plus member, so I expected better than this."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "I'm sorry, Grant. I know this ruined your evening, and that's frustrating, especially as a Plus member. The policy doesn't allow me to give anything beyond the full refund for this kind of problem. Plus raises some limits, but it doesn't add compensation for the inconvenience. The order was never handed over, so it also doesn't count as a late delivery. That means I can't add a credit or goodwill gesture.\n\nYou've been refunded the full $87.55, including the fees and tip. Is there anything else I can help with?"
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Okay, I understand you can't do more than the refund. It's still frustrating, since my kids went to bed hungry and I had to scramble. Thanks for sorting out the refund and getting it back to my Visa. That's all I need for now."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "I'm sorry again, Grant. I hope the kids get a good meal tomorrow. Your refund of $87.55 (reference RF-4000, order Q-8201) is on its way to your Visa. Take care."
  }
